      <div class="key-points">
        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Moutai is a brand; its core products are <strong>sauce aroma</strong> baijiu made in Maotai Town, Guizhou, under the geographical-indication standard GB/T 18356.</li>
          <li>The flagship is Flying Fairy (飞天茅台) at 53% vol. Official guide price is ¥1,499; secondary market prices have run well above that for years.</li>
          <li>Production takes a full year and base spirit ages at least three years before blending — the most labour-intensive cycle in the category.</li>
          <li>Moutai's corporate family includes many cheaper products. They are legitimate baijiu, but they are not the flagship, and the difference is large.</li>
          <li>As a drink, Moutai is excellent and demanding. As an investment, it is a speculative asset with real counterfeit risk.</li>
        </ul>
