            <tr><td>Vintage / aged</td><td>年份酒</td><td>¥5,000+</td><td>15, 30, 50, 80-year expressions; blends built around aged components</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Prince</td><td>茅台王子酒</td><td>¥300–500</td><td>Series product. Sauce aroma, simpler, far cheaper</td></tr>
